      "text": "Requirements A Grabbed, Paralyzed, Restrained, Unconscious, or willing creature is within the Puddles ghoul's reach\n\n---\nEffect The ghoul bites the creature, slurping its blood. This requires an Athletics check against the target's Fortitude DC if the victim is grabbed and is automatic for any of the other conditions. The victim takes 1d6+1 piercing damage and the Puddles ghoul regains 3 healing Hit Points, gaining any excess HP as temporary HP."
